                  "evidence": "Both script suite workflow contexts now install jsonschema>=4.18,<5 using the same interpreter used by their tests. Independent fresh-environment full suite and real pinned smoke pass without schema mocking or validation skips. Shared prerequisite cherry-pick7f183d5 identifies source4d27523d2919b8e0c0e6d0f9287c5e4fc9736e56 and preserves the same six added workflow lines; sprint records sole c1 authorship. This resolves the observed missing dependency mechanism. Current-head hosted CI remains a separate merge gate."
